 "why": "One real sparse bundle and one `continuity` member per case (absent when the case has no such member). Both engines must report the same presence, cover verdict and gap count, and the bundle stays VERIFIED in every case: continuity never gates. A clean cover says only that no discontinuity is detectable in what was presented, never that nothing was omitted."
